# Normalise line endings: text is stored with LF in the repo, checked out native.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalise or diff as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pmtiles binary

# Verbatim licence texts: don't diff, and keep out of GitHub's language stats.
# Both directories, because both hold them. LICENSES/ is the REUSE one (the
# full text of every identifier the tree declares, AGPL-3.0-only included);
# licenses/ holds the data and media terms. Left out, the uppercase directory's
# 100-odd kB of legal text counts as project source and skews the language bar.
licenses/*.txt -diff linguist-vendored
LICENSES/*.txt -diff linguist-vendored
LICENSE        -diff
